    "name": "Results QXscore Data API",
    "description": "With the Results API, you can access the results of your UserTesting account's Surveys, Live Conversations, Interaction Tests, and Think-out-loud Tests for analysis and reporting purposes.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: UserTesting Support\n Email: support@usertesting.com",
